title: "Easy coefficients for Cusick’s original rules matrix in every degree"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Yongxian
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3864-3536"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-27
repository-code: "https://github.com/mxym/math"
abstract: "An all-degree proof identifying the nonzero characteristic multiset of Cusick’s original rules matrix, with its distinguished eigenvalue two removed, as the roots for the easy-coefficients weight formula. The proof models the original matrix as a signed transducer that forgets its initial state after a fixed number of steps. Prior auxiliary shift formulas in all degrees and the quadratic original-matrix identification are credited."
